{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-and-merge-policies","title":"CI 与合入策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation/ci-and-merge-policies","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-与合入策略\">CI 与合入策略</h1><p>门禁要成为门禁，缺不了一台&quot;无条件执行&quot;的机器：不管提交者是谁、动机多急、diff 多小，同一套检查必须原样跑一遍，且结果直接决定代码能否进主干。持续集成（CI）提供前半句，合入策略（merge policy）提供后半句。当 PR 里开始出现大量机器生成的 diff 时，这台机器从效率工具变成了主干质量唯一的系统性担保。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>门禁要成为门禁，缺不了一台<strong>无条件执行</strong>的机器：不管提交者是谁、动机多急、diff 多小，同一套检查必须原样跑一遍。持续集成（CI）提供这份<strong>执行的不可协商性</strong>，合入策略（merge policy）提供「结果直接决定代码能否进主干」的<strong>强制力</strong>。裁决权按可判定性分成三层：确定性检查持<strong>否决权</strong>、AI 审查持<strong>建议权</strong>、人持<strong>批准权与问责权</strong>。排队成本可以用 Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 估算——到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不变时队列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与单个 PR 的验证耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比；而 flake 是乘法放大器：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立检查各有 flake 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 时，PR 首次全绿的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-f)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ci-让同一套门禁对每次改动无条件生效\">CI：让同一套门禁对每次改动无条件生效</h2><p>CI 的核心价值不在&quot;能跑测试&quot;，而在<strong>执行的不可协商性</strong>。GitHub Actions 这类平台的模型是：push 或 PR 触发工作流，工作流里跑什么由仓库内的配置文件声明，与提交者身份无关（见<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/actions/about-github-actions/understanding-github-actions\">官方文档</a>）。这带来两个人类流程给不了的性质：其一，标准对人和 AI 一视同仁——AI 生成的第 50 个 PR 和人写的第 1 个走完全相同的验证路径；其二，结果可审计——每次合入都有对应的绿流水线作为证据链。</p>\n<p>工业界已经把 LLM 审查嵌进这条流水线并给出了实测数据。Ericsson 的经验报告描述了在电信级代码库上用 LLM 自动化评审的落地过程，其定位是缓解资深工程师的评审负担、与测试和静态分析互补（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.19115\">arXiv:2507.19115</a>）。更大规模的证据来自 Atlassian：其 RovoDev Code Reviewer 在 Bitbucket 生态内经过一年期的离线、在线与用户反馈评估，38.70% 的 AI 评论引发了后续提交中的代码修改，PR 周期时间下降 30.8%，人工评审评论数量减少 35.6%（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.01129\">arXiv:2601.01129</a>）。注意这些数字的解读方向：AI 审查<strong>加速了反馈回路、分流了机械性意见</strong>，但整个体系仍然建立在&quot;评论 → 人处理 → 门禁验证&quot;的结构之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合入策略-把条件写死在分支规则里\">合入策略：把条件写死在分支规则里</h2><p>合入策略回答一个问题：满足什么条件，一个 PR 才允许改动主干。成熟平台把它实现为分支级的强制规则而非团队公约：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略条件</th>\n<th>GitHub 机制</th>\n<th>强制的内容</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部检查通过</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository/managing-protected-branches/about-protected-branches\">必需状态检查</a></td>\n<td>测试/类型/lint/构建全绿才可合并</td>\n<td>慢检查会阻塞合入，需并行化与缓存补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任人过目</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners\">CODEOWNERS 必需评审</a></td>\n<td>被改路径的 owner 必须批准</td>\n<td>owner 成为吞吐瓶颈，需按目录合理分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封死绕行通道</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/configuring-branches-and-merges-in-your-repository/managing-rulesets/about-rulesets\">Rulesets 分支规则集</a></td>\n<td>禁止直推主干；绕过权限显式配置且留审计痕迹</td>\n<td>应急通道若滥用，整套策略失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按序验证合入</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/collaborating-with-pull-requests/incorporating-changes-from-a-pull-request/merging-a-pull-request-with-a-merge-queue\">Merge Queue 合并队列</a></td>\n<td>在最新主干之上重跑验证后再真正合入</td>\n<td>队列等待时间换取主干始终可发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套组合的逻辑是承认人性与并发现实：任何&quot;自觉&quot;环节都会在赶工期时被牺牲，而多个 PR 并行验证各自通过、合在一起却互相打破的情形只有按序重验才能排除。合并队列正是为此设计——Graphite 等工具称之为 stack-aware merge queue，按序落地 PR 并保持分支常绿（<a href=\"https://graphite.dev/\">graphite.dev</a>）。它与主干开发（trunk-based development）配合时效果最好：小批量的变更持续流过队列，主干任意时刻都是可发布状态（<a href=\"https://trunkbaseddevelopment.com/\">trunkbaseddevelopment.com</a>）。</p>\n<p>排队成本可以用排队论的第一课估算。Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 说明：到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不变时，队列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与单个 PR 的验证耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比——优化 CI 时长直接缩短队伍。而 flake 是乘法放大器：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立检查各有 flake 概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，PR 首次全绿的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-f)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 时已跌到约 67%，意味着三分之一的 PR 要无意义地重新排队。<strong>检查矩阵越大，每个检查的稳定性要求越高</strong>——这是很多人配 CI 时算错的一笔账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant D as 作者(人或 Agent)&#10;    participant C as CI&#10;    participant R as AI 评审&#10;    participant O as CODEOWNERS 人审&#10;    participant Q as Merge Queue&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;C: push 并开 PR&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;D: 必需状态检查:测试/类型/lint/构建&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;R: 并行触发 AI 审查&#10;    R--&gt;&gt;D: 评论级建议,不计入必需批准&#10;    O--&gt;&gt;Q: owner 批准后进入合并队列&#10;    Q-&gt;&gt;C: 在最新主干上重跑验证&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;Q: 绿则按序合入,红则踢出重试\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant D as 作者(人或 Agent)\n    participant C as CI\n    participant R as AI 评审\n    participant O as CODEOWNERS 人审\n    participant Q as Merge Queue\n    D-&gt;&gt;C: push 并开 PR\n    C-&gt;&gt;D: 必需状态检查:测试/类型/lint/构建\n    C--&gt;&gt;R: 并行触发 AI 审查\n    R--&gt;&gt;D: 评论级建议,不计入必需批准\n    O--&gt;&gt;Q: owner 批准后进入合并队列\n    Q-&gt;&gt;C: 在最新主干上重跑验证\n    C--&gt;&gt;Q: 绿则按序合入,红则踢出重试</pre><h2 id=\"ai-审查者的正确位置-建议层-不是裁决层\">AI 审查者的正确位置：建议层，不是裁决层</h2><p>2025 年以来主流产品对 AI 审查者的定位出奇一致地克制。GitHub 官方文档明确写道：Copilot 的审查<strong>不计入 PR 的必需批准（required approvals），也不会阻塞合并</strong>——它可以被指派为评审者、可以留下意见，但否决权在设计上就不属于它（<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/using-github-copilot/code-review/using-copilot-code-review\">Using Copilot code review</a>）。Graphite 给 Diamond 的宣传语是&quot;the AI reviewer you can collaborate with&quot;——协作对象而非守门人。学术评测侧同样谨慎：CR-Bench 在设计评测协议时刻意强调评审 agent 场景下<strong>假阳性代价高昂</strong>，需要细粒度地区分真问题与噪声（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.11078\">arXiv:2603.11078</a>）。</p>\n<p>这不是产品的保守，而是职责边界的清晰化。可以把合入体系的裁决权分成三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确定性检查持否决权</strong>：测试、类型、构建——结果二值、可复现，错了能立刻指认；</li>\n<li><strong>AI 审查持建议权</strong>：高覆盖、快响应、擅长指出可疑模式，但存在误报与系统性偏差（如需求符合度判断中的过度纠偏），其意见的价值最终由&quot;是否引发有效修改&quot;检验——Atlassian 数据里 61.3% 的评论未引发代码修改，正说明它该被当作线索而非结论；</li>\n<li><strong>人持批准权与问责权</strong>：CODEOWNERS 保证每条路径上有一个具名的人为后果负责。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这与本仓库内容流水线的 Doer≠Judge 原则同构：生成方（无论人或 agent）永远不能兼任自己产出的裁决方。AI 审查之所以只能待在建议层，根本原因是它是生成技术的延伸——用同一个模型的判断去放行同一个模型写出的代码，等于让考生批自己的卷子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"又快又稳-别让关卡变成瓶颈\">又快又稳：别让关卡变成瓶颈</h2><p>强制执行的成本是延迟，而延迟会被反噬成绕行压力。两条工程主线：一是压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>——依赖缓存、任务并行、只跑受影响范围的测试，让必需检查的总时长匹配团队的开合入节奏；二是压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>——flaky 检查要么修复要么移出必需集合，Google 的实践是自动识别并隔离 flaky 测试、限期处理，防止&quot;红了就重试&quot;侵蚀整条流水线的信用（<a href=\"https://testing.googleblog.com/2016/05/flaky-tests-at-google-and-how-we.html\">Flaky Tests at Google</a>）。DORA 2024 年数据里&quot;AI 采用上升伴随交付稳定性下降 7.2%&quot;的另一面读法是：产出提速而验证没提速时，系统会用事故找回平衡——收紧自动化验证比放宽它更符合数据指向（<a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/devops-sre/announcing-the-2024-dora-report\">Google Cloud 官方博客</a>）。小而频繁的 PR 则同时改善两端：diff 小则评审快、验证快、回滚便宜，同样的门禁体系对小批量变更的吞吐远高于攒到很大再一次性过关的模式。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"layered-quality-gates\">分层的质量门禁</a> CI 门是四层结构里的强制力核心，各层触发时机与门禁失效模式在那篇。</p>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"../sustaining-quality-with-ai/evolving-review-and-gates\">演进评审与门禁</a> flaky 率与逃逸率这些信号如何驱动检查矩阵持续调整。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CI 与合入策略把质量要求从公约变成物理事实：必需状态检查封住不合格代码，CODEOWNERS 锁定责任路径，合并队列保住主干常绿。AI 审查在这套体系里的位置是建议层——官方产品设计与实证数据都支持这个边界。运维重心永远有二：压缩验证时长，以及守住每个检查的稳定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 与合入策略","id":"ci-与合入策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CI：让同一套门禁对每次改动无条件生效","id":"ci-让同一套门禁对每次改动无条件生效"},{"level":2,"text":"合入策略：把条件写死在分支规则里","id":"合入策略-把条件写死在分支规则里"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 审查者的正确位置：建议层，不是裁决层","id":"ai-审查者的正确位置-建议层-不是裁决层"},{"level":2,"text":"又快又稳：别让关卡变成瓶颈","id":"又快又稳-别让关卡变成瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试类型与 lint 作为门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/quality-gates-and-automation/tests-types-lint-as-gates"},"next":{"title":"意图违背与对照规格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-assisted-code-review-quality/sustaining-quality-with-ai/intent-violations-and-spec-checks"}}